// AWS DataSync Task Created  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1537, T1567
// Detects creation of DataSync tasks/locations (CreateTask/CreateLocationS3/CreateLocationObjectStorage), which can move large volumes of…
// False positives: Legitimate data-migration and backup jobs.
// Source: rules/exfiltration/datasync-create-task.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^CreateTask$/i or eventName=/^CreateLocationS3$/i or eventName=/^CreateLocationObjectStorage$/i eventSource=/^datasync\.amazonaws\.com$/i
